# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else
# (.git, data/, docs/, research/, tests/, scripts/, src/kestrixbench, .venv, secrets, .env files,
# caches and scratch output) never reaches the Docker daemon or a remote builder.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/kestrix/
!packages/kestrix-scan/pyproject.toml
!packages/kestrix-scan/README.md
!packages/kestrix-scan/LICENSE
!packages/kestrix-scan/NOTICE
!packages/kestrix-scan/src/
!frontend/

# Generated or local-only files inside the allowed directories.
src/kestrix/server/static/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/secrets/
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/data/raw/
**/data/locked/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
